  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 30772027392
    m_Localized: You have died to a loss of time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 550312075264
    m_Localized: What did you expect? Next time try to be faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555143913472
    m_Localized: Don't worry. Aurgus cannot see us here. Also I have something for
      you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 577637965824
    m_Localized: So what you will choice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39704643231744
    m_Localized: So what you will choice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39639769931776
    m_Localized: Next time can you watch your step and don't jump from high heights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39694354604032
    m_Localized: This is a small advice from me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40959943892992
    m_Localized: You have died to a Rush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40991183069184
    m_Localized: Rush is fast, but next time try to find a shelter faster that it
      will catch you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41004558704640
    m_Localized: So what you will choice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50544071139328
    m_Localized: Hello!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50636098363392
    m_Localized: Do you want buy some perks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50514983641088
    m_Localized: Shopper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
